/*  FUNCTION NAME:      NewState
    DESCRIPTION:*//**Returns an empty state for use as a REDUCE accumulator with SetVar/GetVar.*/
/*  RETURNS:            state array: an empty state
    PARAMETERS:
    EXAMPLE:            =SetVar(NewState(), "x", 5) -> state string holding x=5
    NOTE:               Reads from an empty state return #N/A. For REDUCE, seed with SetState(...) populating the slots iteration 1 will read.
    REVISIONS:          Date        Developer   Description
                        2026-04-27  Claude      Initial version
                        2026-11-09  Claude      Help table removed from the formula; its text is the header metadata the argument hints read (#381, #382)
*/
NewState = LAMBDA(
    LET(
    //  Procedure
        result, "",
        result
)
);
